{
  "slug": "eventrise",
  "name": "Eventrise",
  "url": "https://mcp.eventrise.com/mcp",
  "description": "The Eventrise connector lets you run your entire event operation through Claude. From event creation to day-of check-in to post-event reporting.\n\nEvent management: Create, update, and duplicate events. Manage venues, sessions, speakers, and featured event placement. Track launch readiness with event checklists.\n\nTicketing & pricing: Set up ticket types, calculate pricing, and manage availability. Create and track promo codes, issue comped orders, and build reserved seating with full seat map management.\n\nOrders & refunds: Look up orders, reassign tickets between attendees, and handle the full refund workflow — preview, approve, or reject refund requests directly in conversation.\n\nAttendees & check-in: Search attendees, retrieve ticket PDFs, and check in attendees or individual order items in real time on event day.\n\nReporting & insights: Ask questions in plain language and get answers from live data — revenue summaries, sales by day or ticket type, payout and fee breakdowns, check-in rates, promo code performance, abandoned carts, transfers, and refunds.\n\nAutomation: Manage webhook subscriptions to connect Eventrise events to your other tools.\n\nExample prompts: \"How did ticket sales trend this week?\" · \"Create a 20% early-bird promo for Friday's show\" · \"Check in John Smith\" · \"Which events have the most abandoned carts?\"",
